<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Santos keen on MIM oil assets.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Santos keen on MIM oil assets.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil and gas major Santos Ltd said on Friday it was interested in bidding for MIM Holdings Ltd oil and gas interests and would consider a number of acquisition opportunities in the next year.</p>
<p>Managing director Ross Adler said his forecast made at the time of the half year result, that the company was expected to exceed last years results, still prevailed, subject to commodity prices and exchange rate fluctuations.</p>
</text>
